title: "Ghanaian Cultural Lexicon"
message: "If you use the Ghanaian Cultural Lexicon in your research, please cite this dataset."
type: dataset
version: "0.1"
date-released: "2026-08-19"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22017886

authors:
