repository-code: "https://github.com/JosephAppiah-c/Ghanaian-cultural-lexicon"

abstract: >
  The Ghanaian Cultural Lexicon (GCL) is an open, structured and
  community-validated resource documenting Ghanaian language, culture,
  cultural concepts, and their contextual meanings for research,
  education, language preservation, and artificial intelligence and
  natural language processing.
